{
  "version": 1,
  "idle_seconds": 8,
  "hub_rounds": 2,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "name-ask",
      "text": "Stop there, this gate has teeth, so before you lose yours, give me your name.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "named-1",
      "text": "{name}, hmph, I've heard worse,",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "assigned-reply",
      "text": "No proper name? Then you're {name}. Should fit what's left of you.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-ask",
      "text": "So, what's your business at my gate? Spare me the heroic nonsense.",
      "emotion": "suspicion",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-reply",
      "text": "\"{business}\"? Up since dawn on burnt stew, and now this.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-none",
      "text": "Can't make that out. Begging, then. Up since dawn on burnt stew, and now this.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-open-low",
      "text": "You keep cutting me off. Give me one good reason.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-open-mid",
      "text": "You want the gate, I want a reason. So talk.",
      "emotion": "suspicion",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-open-high",
      "text": "Still here? Most folk run by now. So talk.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-again-low",
      "text": "One more word, then we settle this.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.65,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-again-mid",
      "text": "One more, then we settle this. Make it count.",
      "emotion": "impatience",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-again-high",
      "text": "Go on. One more, then we settle this.",
      "emotion": "interest",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-reply-low",
      "text": "Sweet words, rotten smell. I know your sort, {name}.",
      "emotion": "distrust",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-reply-mid",
      "text": "You noticed. Finally, someone with eyes. The gate doesn't lift itself.",
      "emotion": "pride",
      "intensity": 0.65,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-reply-high",
      "text": "Ha! Every stone of it. Tell the captain, he keeps buying me smaller helmets.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.65,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-again",
      "text": "The shoulders again? Flattery's like the stew, worse the second helping.",
      "emotion": "annoyance",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-reply-low",
      "text": "Buying your way out of trouble? Put it away, before I take the hand too.",
      "emotion": "disgust",
      "intensity": 0.75,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-reply-mid",
      "text": "That purse jingles louder than your courage. Gold buys hinges, not me.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-reply-high",
      "text": "Now that's a noise I understand, still, gold buys hinges, not my good opinion,",
      "emotion": "interest",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-again",
      "text": "More coin? Twice now. You must think I'm cheap.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-reply-low",
      "text": "Careful, {name_mangled}. See these dents? The last fool brought a sword, and I kept it.",
      "emotion": "menace",
      "intensity": 0.85,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "quiet threat"
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-reply-mid",
      "text": "You threaten me? Just when I was starting to like you.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.85,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-high",
      "text": "Brave words. Shame about the shaking knees.",
      "emotion": "mockery",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "threaten-again",
      "text": "Again? I kept the last fool's sword, and I've room for yours.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.9,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-reply-low",
      "text": "Now you ask about the camp? Cold beds, burnt stew. Not that you care.",
      "emotion": "weariness",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-reply-mid",
      "text": "Burnt stew, like I said. Cold beds. Excellent wall, though, I built it.",
      "emotion": "pride",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-reply-high",
      "text": "Hah. Nobody ever asks the gatekeeper. Cook burns the stew, captain calls it discipline.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-again",
      "text": "Back to the camp? Fine, the stew's so bad the rats bring their own.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "reckoning-open-low",
      "text": "Right. Last chance. Surprise me.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "reckoning-open-mid",
      "text": "Right. Pay a fair toll, or try your luck and make me laugh.",
      "emotion": "irritation",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "reckoning-open-high",
      "text": "Right, pay a fair toll, or make me laugh.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse-toll",
      "text": "Coins? Now? You've spent all my patience, and that's not for sale!",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 1.0,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "roar"
    },
    {
      "id": "pass-through",
      "text": "Hmph, fair's fair. The toll covers the trouble you brought, so through you go, {name}, and mind the stew.",
      "emotion": "reluctance",
      "intensity": 0.45,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": true,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse-joke",
      "text": "You think that's funny? I eat that stew every night!",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 1.0,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "roar"
    },
    {
      "id": "like-laugh",
      "text": "Hah! The stew! True enough, that cook has dropped more of us than any war.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.75,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "laugh"
    },
    {
      "id": "like-invite",
      "text": "Fine, {name}. Gate's open, and you can sit by my fire tonight. Just this once.",
      "emotion": "fondness",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": true,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse-out",
      "text": "Nobody talks to me like that at my own gate. Out, before I use you to bar it!",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 1.0,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "roar"
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse-walk",
      "text": "Walk away, while it's still your choice.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 1.0,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": true,
      "delivery": "quiet threat"
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-1",
      "text": "Still thinking? Must be a very small thought.",
      "emotion": "mockery",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-2",
      "text": "I could grow another tusk while you decide.",
      "emotion": "impatience",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-3",
      "text": "Gate's not getting any lighter, little traveller.",
      "emotion": "irritation",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-4",
      "text": "Mmm. Even the rats know when to speak.",
      "emotion": "resentment",
      "intensity": 0.4,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "mutter"
    },
    {
      "id": "interrupted",
      "text": "Oi. I was speaking.",
      "emotion": "annoyance",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": -1,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "offtopic-1",
      "text": "That's not an answer, so try again, and make it count.",
      "emotion": "impatience",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": -1,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "offtopic-2",
      "text": "Did I ask about that? Stick to the question, before my patience runs out.",
      "emotion": "irritation",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": -1,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "offtopic-3",
      "text": "You're wasting my day, so give me a real answer, or start walking.",
      "emotion": "annoyance",
      "intensity": 0.65,
      "patience_delta": -1,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "offtopic-last",
      "text": "That's the last of my patience, so one more like that, and you're out.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.75,
      "patience_delta": -1,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "unclear-1",
      "text": "Hm? Speak up, and make some sense this time.",
      "emotion": "suspicion",
      "intensity": 0.4,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "unclear-2",
      "text": "Mumbling won't open my gate, so say it again, plainly.",
      "emotion": "impatience",
      "intensity": 0.45,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    }
  ],
